// Matter steel — Filament 1.77.3. Sample-only; see matter_deformation.vs and MatterDetailAtlas.kt.
//
// steelHash() below is hash11 from "Hash without Sine" by David Hoskins
// (https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4djSRW), used unmodified apart from its name and precision
